---

<section class="cta" id="contact">
  <div class="inner">
    <h2>Ready to bring active intelligence to the street?</h2>
    <p>
      Request a private briefing. We’ll map Agent Jetson to your existing cameras, policies, and
      operational requirements.
    </p>
    <a href="mailto:hello@agentjetson.ai" class="btn">Contact AgentJetson</a>
    <p class="note">agentjetson.ai · agentjetson.com</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .inner {
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    max-width: 32rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: background 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background: #2563eb;
    box-shadow: 0 0 28px var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .note {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
</style>
